# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-9691a1ad247e1783c8e4a0f0da8fcde328524475 "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]].

Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-4d743afe9c3f06ec2c4c187bea499648b8c25cca "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
